==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|-}}, borrowed from {{bor|en|fro|-}}, from {{m|fro|sustenir}} (14c) with the suffix {{m|fr|-ance}}, from {{der|en|VL.|*sustenire}}, from {{der|en|la|sustinere}}. Cf. also Late Latin {{m|la|sustinentia}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsʌs.tə.nbagdbəns/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# Something that provides [[support]] or [[nourishment]].
